<http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/72b5f898-81d1-4598-978e-fc489c18502f-01/CompanyAddress$_ContractNotice1_UBLExtensions1_UBLExtension1_ExtensionContent1_EformsExtension1_Organizations1_Organization3_Company1_PostalAddress1>
